{"title":"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If three times the larger of two numbers is four times the smaller and the difference between the numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the the larger of two numbers is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/c/d5c7d7d3b43d06829f6c28c43ebaf4b342ea3690.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 16 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 24 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 32 \\qquad  \\text{(D)}\\ 44 \\qquad \\text{(E)} \\ 52$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"378\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the smaller number and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be the larger number.   Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/3/8e329d16710c390921e50b0d2756f86ef4dbd195.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3y = 4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/7/747206157a280ef61f9305b9a7bea18baf295ce7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{3}{4}y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"59\" height=\"38\" />.  Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/8/7582fb93c8a9364acf445477c30eb41774f70338.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y - x = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/a/97a4a7e8f837304307e3850b6f26530ad6c9ba38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y - \\frac{3}{4}y = \\frac{1}{4}y = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"136\" height=\"38\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/4/b1428ab597cce38c1d462a75dddae23cf6432a76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\boxed{(\\textbf{C})\\ 32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"99\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME\" title=\"1981 AHSME\">1981 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1981 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1981\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b